{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.poster.avif?t=1766413976\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.webm?t=1766413976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/f3b867ba4aaa2c0764e3608dba9c4dc2.mp4?t=1766413976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><u>PLAY</u></strong></i> through worlds as Belle with the help of her companion Chime. Defeat a variety of enemies and avoid obstacles while you leap through each level! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.poster.avif?t=1766413976\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.webm?t=1766413976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1726760/extras/2ddeaba2dcfdc4a31c4708e21be667f9.mp4?t=1766413976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><u>DISCOVER</u></strong></i> hidden secrets and collectibles hidden in every area. They might just come in handy later!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst